🚨HUGE: OPERA PROPOSES 160M $CELO STAKE TO BECOME KEY NETWORK STAKEHOLDER 

@Opera has proposed a 160M $CELO stake that would transform its @MiniPay distribution partner into a major network stakeholder and one of the largest institutional CELO tokenholders.

The move builds on a five-year partnership with Celo, with @MiniPay having already surpassed 14M users, 420M+ transactions, and expanded to 66 countries and 40+ Mini Apps since its September 2023 launch.
